The same pattern with three fields:
```python
class Time:
    def __init__(self, h, m, s):
        self.h, self.m, self.s = h, m, s

    def __eq__(self, other):
        if not isinstance(other, Time):
            return False
        return (self.h, self.m, self.s) == (other.h, other.m, other.s)
```

